  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing knocks open a mouth in the Flesh Sac Secret Chamber and takes a Gu that looks like spotless white dentures with pearl-like luster. Fang Yuan names that find Flesh-bone Gu. Bai Ning Bing mumbles the saying about raising the dead and growing flesh on white bone.",
        "chapters": [
          224
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "loc_flesh_sac_secret_chamber",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While planning the Bai Gu mountain white bone inheritance, Fang Yuan first recalls this Gu as a famous rank three healing Gu, written as “flesh white bones”: prior-life memory of the unrebirthed timeline, where Bai Hua received it and became a famous healing Gu Master. He places it under the healing use-category when he lists Gu by function.",
        "chapters": [
          214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "prior-life-memory",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain",
          "sys_healing_gu",
          "char_bai_hua"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing offers Flesh-bone Gu to Fang Yuan in exchange for Yang Gu. Fang Yuan refuses. She keeps the Gu in hand after that refusal.",
        "chapters": [
          224
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_yang_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the bone flesh unity refinement she gives it to Fang Yuan so he can refine it under Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura. He returns it because he still cannot use it, and she heals both of their cut forearms with it.",
        "chapters": [
          226
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bone-flesh-unity-handoff",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "By the Shang clan city stretch it has been returned to her as hers.",
        "chapters": [
          273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bone-flesh-unity-handoff",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With the strength of two boars, one bear, and a crocodile, self-reliance Gu’s healing is on par with flesh-bone Gu, and further strength gains would push it past that mark.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "healing-benchmark",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_reliance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once he trades a boar’s strength for bull strength, horse strength and half a turtle’s, self-reliance Gu’s effect has surpassed flesh-bone.",
        "chapters": [
          299
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "healing-benchmark",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later narration states self-reliance Gu’s healing has far surpassed flesh-bone Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          342
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "healing-benchmark",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
